# Build context for docker/host/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads this file instead of the
# root .dockerignore). Unlike `make local`, the hosted image carries its catalog: a
# cloud platform has no checkout to bind-mount. Only the problems host mode offers
# are included, and scripts/local-host/browser-metadata.ts narrows the UI build to
# the same reviewed public metadata. CloudFormation templates stay on the host.
.git
.gitmodules
problems/*
!problems/battles/
problems/battles/*
!problems/battles/ac26-crypto-battle/
!problems/challenges/
problems/challenges/*
!problems/challenges/sqli-demo/
!problems/challenges/hello-world/
problems/**/.git

node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/cdk.out
**/cdk.out.test
**/.turbo
.tenkacloud/
tmp/
.claude/
sampleimages/
docs/
landing/
apps/participant-portal/public/runtime-config.json
